I did not check the incident list for a duplicate, but the key should prevent one.\n\nThe incident summary records the rollback, the partial failure, and the post-rollback status. Two follow-ups remain open: root-causing the v2.3.1 failure, and investigating why the orchestrator halted the first rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}